1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,526
The bottom template runs the other way.

2
00:00:02,526 --> 00:00:08,697
So here the polymerase must work away from the fork, in short backward pieces.

3
00:00:08,697 --> 00:00:13,945
Each piece is started by a little RNA primer, laid down by primase.

4
00:00:13,945 --> 00:00:19,687
These pieces are Okazaki fragments, a thousand to two thousand nucleotides long.

5
00:00:19,687 --> 00:00:21,419
This is the lagging strand.

